        This is like the concept of Semantic Primes, which alludes to
        the prime factorization of numbers.<br>
        As an inspiring example, Schemers point to how all computations
        can be expressed in terms of: lambda, recursion, if, quote,
        cons, car, cdr, and maybe a thing or two more -- I forget.<br>
        <br>
        So, content words in lojban get defined in a dictionary in terms
        of other words.<br>
